				     groups, both using the TotalBet strategy. No renderStyle here: every tile keeps the historical default
				     overlay look (white, bold, 18px, black outline). Add a <renderStyle> to a group to style it - see
				     NorseLegend for a worked paid/unpaid/never-pay example. -->
				<group name="LocatedScatterPaid" strategy="TotalBet" paid="true">
